HivePulse 1.0.5

New in this build:
• Impossible values are refused before they are saved: no inspection dated in the year 3000, no 5000 mites, no apiary at 999 degrees north
• The forms show their own limits instead of leaving that to the server
• Error messages arrive in your language and name the field they are about
• One name per thing, on every screen and in every language

Please stay in the test and keep using the app now and then.

